  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Your truck is the projectile. Drive down the wide slope and up the real
    curved launch ramp. Speed, entry line and direction determine the flight. Adjacent
    competitors can physically jostle and collide in the air. No automatic scoring
    trajectory is supplied. Small wings unfold after leaving the lip. Limited horizontal
    aftertouch nudges the path; release forward/back once to arm range correction.
    Total correction is bounded; gravity always remains downward. ACTION dives once:
    wings fold, lift ends and descent becomes heavier. The same controls, grip, momentum,
    aftertouch and dive apply to AI.


    First valid descending contact on the
    target''s TOP locks the projected chassis-center score:10outer,25middle,50precision,100tiny
    bullseye. Smaller zones have inclusive edges and take precedence. Side/underside
    contacts do not score. Later bumps, slides, crashes and falls cannot revoke or
    increase a locked result. Missed approach, ground crash or generous simulation
    timeout scores zero.


    Five launches each; total points win. Tied leaders
    receive equal-opportunity extra launches until resolved. Solo stores a personal
    best. Starts rotate; wind, target layout and moving precision sections are shared
    by everyone in a round. Later rounds increase visible wind and slowly move the
    precision zone. Each human keeps an independent stable chase pane; AI-only uses
    a broadcast. Once all resolve, a shared actual-motion replay offers angle, speed,
    rewind and skip. Pause/reconnect preserves bodies, attempts and scores; release
    and freshly confirm after source replacement. Offline only.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
